  "worked_solution": "To work out ${(-\\frac{9}{2})}^{2},$ we multiply $-\\frac{9}{2}$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(-\\frac{9}{2})}^{2} & = \\\\ (-\\frac{9}{2})\\cdot (-\\frac{9}{2}) & = \\\\ \\frac{9\\cdot 9}{2\\cdot 2} & = \\\\ \\frac{81}{4} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
